#: docs/document-ingestion.md:50
msgid "That last row is the one that costs sessions. The corpus-grep checklist searches  only — so a paper still sitting in  does not merely go unread, it makes a clean grep read as \"nobody has done this\" while the source is sitting on disk. An un-ingested source is worse than an absent one, because it produces false confidence rather than a gap."
